      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1655 the Battle of the Severn saw Puritan forces defeat Royalist troops led by Governor William Stone, securing Protestant rule.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
